{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50830","headline":"马迹石 · 缪岛云","name":"马迹石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堪信曾鸾驾，寻僊道已成。\n因过盘石上，如印玉沙行。\n苔逐方圆匝，泉随深浅生。\n临回山色暮，拂拂翠云平。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缪岛云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}